`Brute force: 4625 failed logons clustered per source over 5 minutes. Tune the count threshold for noisy auth sources.`
index=wineventlog sourcetype="*WinEventLog:Security" EventCode=4625
| eval src_ip = coalesce(src_ip, IpAddress, "unknown")
| bin _time span=5m
| stats count by _time, src_ip
| where count > 5
| sort - count
